<div class="mandarin-hanzi">对不起</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">duìbuqǐ</div>

''Meaning:'' I’m sorry; excuse me (apology)  
''Part of speech:'' interjection

!! In context
对不起，我来晚了。 — Duìbuqǐ, wǒ lái wǎn le. — Sorry, I arrived late.

!! Usage note
A conventional apology, not the usual way to attract attention. For 'Excuse me, may I ask…', use 请问 (qǐngwèn). 不 is neutral here.
